<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Pretty Green Eyes - Radio Edit</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Ultrabeat</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Pretty Green Eyes (Remixes)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">71NJqORRmwlcZSLk0VsFjU</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.890" end="00:06.420">Pretty green eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.420" end="00:09.430">So full of sparkle and such light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.430" end="00:13.610">Let me remind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.610" end="00:16.470">You chose not to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.470" end="00:20.280">It's all right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.280" end="00:23.690">For your lover has come home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.690" end="00:27.500">By your side I＇ll always stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.500" end="00:34.300">Never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.300" end="00:41.020">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.020" end="00:43.950">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.950" end="00:47.300">Pretty green eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.300" end="00:50.530">So full of wonder and despair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.530" end="00:54.210">It's all right to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.210" end="00:57.250">For I＇ll be there to wipe your tears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.250" end="01:01.020">And in your arms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.020" end="01:04.270">Together we＇re in paradise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.270" end="01:08.350">And it's so nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.350" end="01:15.630">You＇ll never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.630" end="01:22.460">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.460" end="01:29.260">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.260" end="01:36.070">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.070" end="01:38.750">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.750" end="01:42.190">Pretty green eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.190" end="01:45.430">So full of sparkle and such light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.430" end="01:49.510">Let me remind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.510" end="01:52.360">You chose not to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.360" end="01:56.230">It's all right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.230" end="01:59.600">For your lover has come home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.600" end="02:03.430">By your side I＇ll always stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.430" end="02:10.420">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.420" end="02:17.150">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.150" end="02:19.900">You never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.900" end="02:23.280">Pretty green eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.280" end="02:26.450">So full of wonder and despair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.450" end="02:30.110">It's all right to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.110" end="02:33.260">For I＇ll be there to wipe your tears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.260" end="02:37.090">And in your arms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.090" end="02:40.290">Together we＇re in paradise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.290" end="02:44.630">And it's so nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.630" end="02:48.110">You＇ll never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.110" end="02:50.270">Never have to be  never have to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.270" end="02:54.900">Never have to  never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.900" end="02:57.150">Never have to be  never have to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.150" end="03:01.750">Never have to  never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.750" end="03:04.180">Never have to be  never have to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.180" end="03:08.640">Never have to  never have to be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.640" end="03:10.810">Never have to be  never have to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.810" end="03:14.810">Never have to  never have to be alone</p></div></body></tt>